  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (這支流程是 SRC_BAPIv2.2_VAL_TBL_EXPORT_E 模組的最上層主流程，功能非常單純：從SAP的單位主表（T006/T006A）撈出「內部單位」對照資料，並輸出到Excel檔案，供後續BAPI註冊(登錄資料)時使用的單位轉換參考表。)&#xA;Acquires the internal unit of measure required for BAPI registration from the SAP table [T006 / T006A] and outputs it to an Excel file.&#xA;&#xA;- Arguments&#xA;    in_SAPService as Connected session information &lt;IConnectionService&gt;&#xA;    in_FilePath as File path of Excel file to convert&lt;String&gt;&#xA;    in_LanguageKey as T006A(SPRAS : Language Key) &lt;String&gt;&#xA;" DisplayName="SRC_BAPIv2.2_VAL_TBL_EXPORT_E" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="1071,1504" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_4">
    <Sequence.Variables>
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Default="SRC_BAPIv2.2_VAL_TBL_EXPORT_E" Name="WorkflowName" />
    </Sequence.Variables>
    <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
      <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
        <x:Boolean x:Key="IsExpanded">True</x:Boolean>
        <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
      </scg:Dictionary>
    </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    <ui:Comment sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="完整呼叫關係圖&#xA;&#xA;SRC_BAPIv2.2_VAL_TBL_EXPORT_E.xaml（主流程）&#xA; ├─ CheckArgument.xaml              → 驗證輸入參數是否正確&#xA; └─ GetUnitsOfMeasurement.xaml      → 撈單位對照表並輸出Excel&#xA;      ├─ GetT006.xaml               → 撈SAP單位主表&#xA;      └─ GetT006A.xaml              → 撈對應語系的單位文字表" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,264" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_1" Text="//">
      <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
        <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
          <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
        </scg:Dictionary>
      </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    </ui:Comment>
    <ui:Comment sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="這支流程在整套系統裡的角色&#xA;它產出的這份「單位對照Excel」，正是您之前問過的 SRC_BAPIv2.2_VALTBL_CNV_E 模組（ConvertUnits.xaml、DataConversion.xaml等）在做「外部單位→SAP內部單位」轉換時，所依賴的參考資料來源！也就是說：&#xA;&#xA;SRC_BAPIv2.2_VAL_TBL_EXPORT_E.xaml  ──產出──►  單位對照Excel  ──被讀取──►  SRC_BAPIv2.2_VALTBL_CNV_E\ReadConversionTarget.xaml / ConvertUnits.xaml&#xA;&#xA;簡單來說，這是一支「建立單位換算字典」的準備工具，先把SAP裡的單位對照關係整理成Excel，後續其他模組在做資料轉換時才有東西可以查表對照。&#xA;CheckArgument.xaml（VAL_TBL_EXPORT_E版本）跟TABLEDA" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,379" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_3" Text="//">
      <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
        <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
          <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
        </scg:Dictionary>
      </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    </ui:Comment>
